# Annotation round 3

Status: accepted as directional references with reservations on 29 September 2026. User requirements and the [annotation needs](../../annotation-system-needs.md) override generated pixels. No application behavior was implemented or verified by these mockups.

## Final user review — binding reservations

- Embedded review (image index 1): the surrounding Overview panel does not match the previously defined Overview design. Acceptance applies to reuse of the annotation component; retain the established Overview layout when implementing.
- Batch overlay (image index 2): use the full available panel height. The shortened floating list in the image is not the intended geometry. Keep each annotation editor compact within that full-height host.
- All three images are accepted direction, not pixel-perfect specifications. Apply recorded corrections and the shared component architecture despite image-generation noise.

